  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Static Electricity**: back after 46 archived shows (537 days) [3]\n- **East West Link**: back after 83 archived shows (856 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Antartica**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Gilgamesh [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-08-27** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 146 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-08-27.bandcampbootlegger**: soundboard; 19 songs; 147 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Amby Food Poisoning, Jason Galea, John Farnham, Some Kind Of Monster, Stu's Singlet [1]\n- Ambrose shouted out opener Geese after the song Doom City [1]\n- Cavanagh teased a Led Zeppelin cover before playing Daily Blues [1]\n- Le Risque was introduced as a little bit of ZZ Top [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-08-27**: taped by furrythug; transferred by furrythug; source: Zoom H4essential [1]\n- **kglw2024-08-27.bandcampbootlegger**: taped by Sam Joseph; source: SBD [2]. Also: Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, and Grace recorded the performance for the band [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Jason Galea Standard Edition: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2024-08-27 The Dell Music Center, Philadelphia, PA, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-august-27-2024-the-dell-music-center-philadelphia-pa-usa.html) [4]\n- Poster by I Just Read About That...: [King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard / Geese (The Dell Music Center, Philadelphia PA, August 27, 2024) DID NOT ATTEND](https://ijustreadaboutthat.com/2024/08/27/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-geese-the-dell-music-center-philadelphia-pa-august-27-2024-did-not-attend/) [5]",
